- `rfDdtype::AbstractString` (spec: string): Response filter by Cross reference database type, e.g EMBL, RefSeq, Ensembl, etc. Comma separated values accepted.
- `rfDbid::AbstractString` (spec: string): Response filter by all UniParc cross reference accessions, eg. AAC02967 (EMBL) or  XP_006524055 (RefSeq). Comma separated values accepted.
